    "created_at": "2016-10-31T18:30:05Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-10-31T18:30:15Z",
    "body": "Yeah, we might be able to ask @tabatkins for a mode that warns when the `<a>`'s `for=\"\"` doesn't match the `<dfn>`'s `for=\"\"`. I think the current mode is just geared around avoiding ambiguities in the current ecosystem, not around being future-proof.\n",
